  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile L8 investigation): re-parent to INV-rotup. Undocumented HYPERGUMBO_* env vars and HF_HUB_OFFLINE are a clean extension of the CLI-text-drift mechanic INV-rotup covers (CLI surface promises vs reality, no enforcement gate). Also relevant to INV-dasig (P0 huggingface.co touch) because HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 is currently the only documented workaround."  # db2d
